  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "A. ferrooxidans DSM 14882T inoculum (10%) was grown in 125 mL serum flasks under anaerobic conditions for 7 days in 50 mL of modified 9K medium, which contained (g L−1): 0.4 (NH4)2SO4, 0.4 MgSO4·7H2O, 0.4 KH2PO4 and 1 mL of trace element solution."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "The trace element solution contained (mg L−1): 62 MnCl2·2H2O, 68 ZnSO4·7H2O, 64 CoCl2·6H2O, 30 H3BO3, 10 Na2MoO4, 66 CuCl2·2H2O and 30 NaVO3."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "The pH was adjusted to 1.8 with concentrated H2SO4."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "The medium was made anoxic by purging with N2 gas for 30 min."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "The medium was supplemented with 2.5 g L−1 Fe2(SO4)3 as the electron acceptor, while 2.50 mmol H2 was supplied as the electron donor by filling the 75 mL headspace with an H2:CO2 (80:20, v/v) gas mix using 0.8 bar overpressure."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}